    "detailed_description": "<strong>NONETHELESS</strong> has a rather simple puzzle system at its core. As you progress through numerous levels, that system gets expanded upon. You have the freedom to explore those expansions how you see fit; through overworld levels that contain challenges of their own.<br><br>Your objective is straightforward; navigate the pawn, past doors and obstacles, to the exit in each level. There are colored buttons, rooms, and doors. Pressing a button with the pawn will light up the corresponding room and open its doors, but the number of rooms that can be lit is limited. That's already a mouthful, but it will get much more mouthfulling than that...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>200+ levels that each introduce a new idea<br></li><li>An &quot;overworld&quot; that contains challenges and secrets of its own<br></li><li>Simple controls: 4-directional, grid-based movement<br></li><li>&quot;Undo&quot; and level &quot;reset&quot; buttons, which encourage experimentation without penalty<br></li><li>No time-based or quick movement puzzles</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847500/extras/6188c7bbc79b1b9ccb9e42808d11a834.poster.avif?t=1712921124\" width=464 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847500/extras/6188c7bbc79b1b9ccb9e42808d11a834.webm?t=1712921124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847500/extras/6188c7bbc79b1b9ccb9e42808d11a834.mp4?t=1712921124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
